     "id": "business/2026-10 Performance report.md",
     "name": "2026-10 Performance report",
     "title": "Casa Verde Hotels: October performance",
     "text": "# Casa Verde Hotels: October performance\n\nPrepared by Brightline Studio · Period: 1–31 October 2026\n\n| Channel | Spend | Direct bookings | CPA |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Google Search | €6,300 | 300 | €21 |\n| Meta (prospecting) | €4,560 | 120 | €38 |\n| Meta (retargeting) | €1,800 | 95 | €19 |\n\n## What we learned\nGoogle Search brings the cheapest bookings. Meta prospecting is above target, so we moved €2,000 from Meta prospecting to Google Search for November.\n\n## Issues\nThe Tulum landing page returned a 404 on 28 October and Google disapproved four ads until it was fixed.",
