     "name": "2026-10-27 Email - opening moved (Posta)",
     "title": "Email: Valle de Bravo opening moved to 3 March",
     "text": "# Email: Valle de Bravo opening moved to 3 March\n\nSaved from Posta · From Sofía Medina <sofia.medina@casaverde.example> · 27 October 2026\n\nHi Inês,\n\nQuick heads-up: the Valle de Bravo opening has moved from 15 February to 3 March. Construction is running late.\n\nCould you send me a revised launch media plan with the new dates by Thursday? My director wants to see it before our Friday budget meeting. If the shift means we lose any early booking discounts on the media side, flag it.\n\nThanks,\nSofía",
